    },
    {
      "line_number": 18,
      "text": "Introduction: This paper reports the findings of a systematic review which evaluates the evidence from RCTs regarding the effectiveness of",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        264,
        904.65
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1997,
        944.65
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 19,
      "text": "complementary and alternative medical interventions (CAM) in reducing anxiety in parents whose children suffer from malignancies.",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        263,
        927.65
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1996,
        967.65
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 20,
      "text": "Method: CINAHL, COCHRANE, EMBASE, PUBMED, SCOPUS and PSYCINFO electronic databases were searched, based on the following",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        261,
        950.65
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1994,
        990.65
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 21,
      "text": "search terms: parent*, child*, anxiety, complementary, psychological, cognitive, behavioral, interventions, cancer, leukemia, lymphoma, 'brain",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        264,
        974.15
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1997,
        1014.15
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 22,
      "text": "tumors'.",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        261,
        995.65
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1994,
        1035.65
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 23,
      "text": "Results: In total 9 studies met the eligibility criteria. Six RCT's were pilot studies. Five trials targeted parents of children undergoing bone marrow",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        262,
        1020.65
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1995,
        1060.65
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 24,
      "text": "transplantation, two studies targeted parents of children with various cancer diagnoses and two others targeted parents of children with leukemia.",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        260,
        1043.65
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1993,
        1083.65
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 25,
      "text": "A variety of stress reduction techniques were reported. Overall, 5/9 of the studies reported the use of massage therapy. In two out of the five studies",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        260,
        1067.15
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1993,
        1107.15
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 26,
      "text": "which used massage therapy on children as an intervention, massage was accompanied with relaxation/imagery in the first and in the second,",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        260,
        1090.15
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1993,
        1130.15
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 27,
      "text": "parents delivered acupressure to their children. Two other studies used breathing techniques/guided imagery, another one used relaxation training",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        263,
        1114.15
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1996,
        1154.15
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 28,
      "text": "and the last one used inhalation aromatherapy.",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        264,
        1137.15
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1997,
        1177.15
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 29,
      "text": "Conclusions: The methodological quality of reviewed RCT's studies was low and many failed to provide sufficient information in order to assess",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        265,
        1160.15
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1998,
        1200.15
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 30,
      "text": "their quality on many of the methodological indicators. Although, the review did not provide strong evidence in favor of CAM interventions,",
      "font_size": 19,
      "fitted_size": 19,
      "panel_xy": [
        264,
        1183.15
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        1997,
        1223.15
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
